  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-01T01:16:08.742Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Version: 2019.2.5\n\nDescription of the bug:\nAttempting to take pictures using the timer button on the stream camera will play the 'count down' and 'shutter' sound effects as expected, but only the first picture to be taken through this method will be saved to your computer.\n\nThe photo camera works without issue.\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nPlay in VR,\nSpawn the stream camera,\nPress the timer button,\nWait for the countdown and picture to be taken,\nPress the timer button again,\nWait for the countdown and picture to be taken again,\nCheck the directory that pictures are saved to, only the first picture you took will have been saved\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): N/A",
